            <title><![CDATA[Stormy Thanksgiving weather causes delays and damages for many Americans]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/stormy-thanksgiving-weather-causes-delays-and-damages-for-many-americans</link>
            <description><![CDATA[A stormy Thanksgiving day led to serious flooding, major power outages and disrupted travel plans. By Thursday evening, more than 900,000 customers were without power in at least eight states. The East Coast is grappling with a pair of storm systems affecting people from Maine to Florida. This as strong winds battered the West Coast from Oregon to California. Lisa Desjardins reports.]]></description>
