            <title><![CDATA[Despite political divide, Americans often 'speak in one voice']]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/despite-political-divide-americans-often-speak-in-one-voice</link>
            <description><![CDATA[In this era of sharp American divide, politics has increasingly become a dish families work to keep off the Thanksgiving table. But in reality, data show Americans actually agree on many tough topics, spanning more than 100 policies. Lisa Desjardins spoke with two leading researchers whose counter-intuitive findings suggest our division is based on politics, not policy.]]></description>
